# 📦 Installation Guide

## Prerequisites

- **Google Chrome** version 88 or higher
- **Basic understanding** of browser extensions
- **Enable Developer Mode** in Chrome extensions page

## 🚀 Quick Installation

### Method 1: From Chrome Web Store (Coming Soon)
1. Visit the [Chrome Web Store](https://chrome.google.com/webstore)
2. Search for "HyperScraper Pro"
3. Click "Add to Chrome"
4. Confirm installation when prompted

### Method 2: Manual Installation (Developer Mode)

1. **Download the extension**
   ```bash
   # Option A: Download ZIP
   # Go to GitHub releases and download the latest .zip file
   
   # Option B: Clone repository
   git clone https://github.com/yourusername/hyper-scraper-pro.git